{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by either curiosity or recklessness, you activated an unstable Driftgate and were catapulted into strange, hostile worlds beyond your own. Ruindrift is a fast-paced, tight, real-time  RPG that distills the intensity of MMO arenas and the tension and precision of Souls-like combat into a focused single-player experience. With challenging combat that\u2019s simple to learn, fight your way through each gate and find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/extras/8c2ec55771842dd1764b380374f69ad5.poster.avif?t=1774025187\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/extras/8c2ec55771842dd1764b380374f69ad5.webm?t=1774025187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/extras/8c2ec55771842dd1764b380374f69ad5.mp4?t=1774025187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused combat</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Free movement is replaced with deliberate timing and reaction. Dodge, vanish, block, and stun with precision to outplay every enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast battles -</strong>\u00a0Fights last only a few minutes, so you can hop in for quick progress or play longer sessions to push further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Variety of builds and classes</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Play as anything from the explosive Fireborn to a feral Wildkin, each with their own style. Combine abilities, unlock new skills, and stack buffs to transform how you fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Simple to learn combat that rewards sharp reactions, smart defenses, and well-timed attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and items</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Level up, collect powerful gear, and adapt to tougher battles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty options</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Adjust the pace and intensity to match your style of play. Difficulty doesn\u2019t scale enemy health or damage, but alters their reaction time and behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556050?t=1774025187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556050?t=1774025187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/2e1f459fdc5ea258b8f0d74368e9339f22011927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774025187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/2e1f459fdc5ea258b8f0d74368e9339f22011927/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774025187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by either curiosity or recklessness, you activated an unstable D