li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and items</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Level up, collect powerful gear, and adapt to tougher battles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty options</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Adjust the pace and intensity to match your style of play. Difficulty doesn\u2019t scale enemy health or damage, but alters their reaction time and behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Plunk Oak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556050/db198597372c05333fd7578d29627c5ec7ebe96e/header.jpg?t=1774025187","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556050/650011787/91f5a4080460e01595ef10c92bc1f38ed998b146/1759909688/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760047018","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556050/650011787/91f5a4080460e01595ef10c92bc1f38ed998b146/1759909688/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760047018","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556050/650011787/91f5a4080460e01595ef10c92bc1f38ed998b146/1759909688/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760047018","id":257214140,